      {
       "t": "text",
       "html": "<p>Serving the Washington DC area with fast and reliable delivery.</p>"
      },
      {
       "t": "button",
       "text": "Shop Now",
       "href": "/shop/"
      },
      {
       "t": "text",
       "html": "<p>Weed Delivery in the DC and Baltimore area is easy and convenient when you order from Lifted. Cannabis enthusiasts that are interested in convenience can shop online from wherever they happen to be. Just place your order, and we’ll dispatch one of our friendly and discreet drivers from our dispensary in Washington DC. Let Lifted come to you! We can deliver up to 100 miles. Not in range? Let’s talk about it! Just call <a href=\"tel:7712161684\">(771) 216-1684</a>. We’re always happy to work with you so that you can enjoy the very best top-shelf weed.</p>"
      },
